  "summary": "encoded[i]=arr[i] xor arr[i+1]，已知 arr 首元素 first，恢复完整 arr。",
  "insight": "异或可逆：arr[i+1]=arr[i] xor encoded[i]。从已知首项顺序递推即可。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "结果长度比 encoded 多一",
    "异或同一数两次会抵消",
    "按顺序使用刚恢复的前一项"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "xor-prefix-reconstruction",
      "title": "异或前缀恢复",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用相邻异或关系逐项解码。",
      "steps": [
        "answer[0]=first",
        "i 从零到 encoded.length-1",
        "answer[i+1]=answer[i] xor encoded[i]，返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
